+# Terminology Audit v1 — networking-first vocabulary (Phase 1, no-PR)
+
+- **Job:** `packet-plumber-terminology-audit` · **Branch:** `pp-terminology-audit` (local, no PR)
+- **Date:** 2026-08-15 · **Base:** v2
+- **Canon (user ruling 2026-08-15):** the player is a network engineer; the game is a networking game →
+  **real networking terms unless the software term is more accurate** (arrays, stack, pool, queue — keep) **or the
+  word is game identity** (bundle, demolish, severance, era, set-piece, pipe, junction (router), surge — Mini
+  Motorways lineage / plumbing metaphor / user-ruled topology terminology; they make no networking claim).
+- **Phase 1 deliverable:** this inventory + decision table + proposed canon line. The interactive ruling surface was
